body:
> Never mind; I can't send you a personal message - no email address with Github?

I do actually but now that you mention it... I haven't received a PM in ages.

> 1.) We stick with the solution above. We document that setting the honorCipherOrder option is identical to setting the SSL_OP_CIPHER_SERVER_PREFERENCE on secureOptions.

I can live with that but use this instead:

``` javascript
var secureOptions = options.secureOptions || 0;
if (options.honorCipherOrder) secureOptions |= constants.SSL_OP_CIPHER_SERVER_PREFERENCE;
if (secureOptions) this.secureOptions = secureOptions;
```

It's kind of silly to set `this.secureOptions` conditionally but let's do it anyway for the sake of backwards compatibility.

