body:
This actually makes the code harder to read. The previous line fit within the 120 character limit.

If it _did_ break the 120 character limit, the better change would be:

```
foreach ($this->_rules['allResources']['byRoleId'] as
    $roleIdCurent => $rules
) {
    ...
}
```

This is more consistent with other rules - like putting implements on the following line, or, in the case of long parameter lists or conditions, putting the closing paren and opening brace on a line by themselves.

